### CADASTRO
POST http://localhost:3000/usuario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Bruce Wayne",
    "username": "wayne_br",
    "email": "wayne@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123456",
    "role": "admin"
}

